# Tern: Data Layer

**Single source of truth:** Core content lives in `src/data/questions.js`; depth nodes in `src/data/depthGraph.js`. Do not hardcode question text, nudges, follow-up triggers, or illustration filenames in components or engine.

**questions.js:** Core question schema includes `id`, `title`, `illustration`, `setup`, `assumptions`, `question`, `phase: 'core'`, `answers` (with `id`, `text`, `nudges`), optional `followUp` (trigger, illustration, weight, same answer shape). Nudge keys: O, C, H, L, S; positive = first pole, negative = second.

**depthGraph.js:** Node schema includes `probesAxes`, `probeTension`, `isClarifying`; same answer/nudge shape. No archetypes file.

**Axis keys:** O/R, C/I, H/T, L/P, S/D. Use these in all nudge definitions.
